WEBVTT

00:00:00.328 --> 00:00:04.869
In March 2019, a phase three trial in
metastatic Ewing sarcoma, a paediatric
cancer,

00:00:04.869 --> 00:00:06.545
was recommended to close early.

00:00:06.832 --> 00:00:10.302
Its drug, ganitumab, blocks a receptor
called IGF-1R.

00:00:10.302 --> 00:00:15.277
Earlier trials had seen tumours shrink. So
why did adding it change nothing?

00:00:16.342 --> 00:00:18.989
Every number you will see comes from a cited
source.

00:00:20.098 --> 00:00:25.223
IGF-1R sits on the cell surface. When the
growth factor IGF-1 binds it, a signal

00:00:25.223 --> 00:00:28.298
passes inside. Ganitumab is meant to block
that.

00:00:28.584 --> 00:00:32.615
In mice, blocking it shrank Ewing tumours
and helped chemotherapy.

00:00:32.901 --> 00:00:38.326
In patients whose disease had come back, a
related antibody, R1507, shrank tumours

00:00:38.326 --> 00:00:40.112
in about one in ten of 115.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:44.951
Ganitumab's own phase two: 2 of 35
responded, six percent, pooling Ewing with a

00:00:44.951 --> 00:00:49.501
related tumour. Later cited: eleven percent
with a response or prolonged stable

00:00:49.501 --> 00:00:49.962
disease.

00:00:50.248 --> 00:00:54.117
On that evidence, ganitumab got an orphan
designation for Ewing sarcoma, and

00:00:54.117 --> 00:00:55.186
NantCell licensed it.

00:00:56.268 --> 00:00:59.784
The phase three, AEWS1221, changed the
question.

00:00:59.784 --> 00:01:05.425
The hopeful trial: 38 relapsed patients, not
randomised, judged on shrinkage.

00:01:05.425 --> 00:01:11.432
This one: 312 newly diagnosed patients,
randomised, judged on event-free survival,

00:01:11.432 --> 00:01:14.509
ganitumab added to intensive chemotherapy.

00:01:14.796 --> 00:01:20.326
The target: a hazard ratio of 0.67. It
compares how often events like relapse or

00:01:20.326 --> 00:01:25.718
death happen in each arm. One means no
difference; 0.67, a third fewer events.

00:01:26.374 --> 00:01:31.703
In the protocol's model, median event-free
survival would stretch from 16.6 to 24.4

00:01:31.703 --> 00:01:35.298
months. 300 patients gave 81 percent power
to detect it.

00:01:35.954 --> 00:01:40.746
Notice the jump. Shrinkage in one in ten
relapsed patients, asked to deliver a third

00:01:40.746 --> 00:01:43.371
fewer events on top of intensive
chemotherapy.

00:01:43.371 --> 00:01:44.854
Is that the same question?

00:01:46.738 --> 00:01:52.349
In 298 eligible patients, at three years,
37.4 percent on standard treatment were

00:01:52.349 --> 00:01:56.020
alive without an event. With ganitumab, 39.1
percent.

00:01:56.306 --> 00:02:01.094
The lines are 95 percent confidence
intervals: how precise each estimate is, not
how

00:02:01.094 --> 00:02:03.830
much patients varied. They almost fully
overlap.

00:02:04.116 --> 00:02:08.313
Overall survival: 59.5 percent against 56.7
percent.

00:02:08.601 --> 00:02:14.014
The hazard ratio was 1.00, with an interval
from 0.76 to 1.33.

00:02:14.014 --> 00:02:17.069
The hoped-for 0.67 sits outside it.

00:02:18.538 --> 00:02:23.161
Before the formal inefficacy boundary was
crossed, the DSMC recommended closing the

00:02:23.161 --> 00:02:27.784
trial, citing the outcomes and a possible
rise in pneumonitis, a lung inflammation.

00:02:28.070 --> 00:02:33.149
2.7% with ganitumab against 0.7% without,
including the only grade five event.

00:02:33.149 --> 00:02:37.511
All four severe cases on ganitumab had
received chest radiotherapy.

00:02:38.608 --> 00:02:41.596
So where could the chain have broken? We
check eight links.

00:02:41.882 --> 00:02:47.234
Target: Open Targets lists only literature
support for IGF1R in Ewing sarcoma, 0.83,

00:02:47.234 --> 00:02:50.802
with no genetic, somatic or functional
genomic evidence.

00:02:51.089 --> 00:02:55.859
Dependency: the trial group questioned
whether Ewing sarcoma needs IGF-1R as much
as

00:02:55.859 --> 00:02:56.881
the lab suggested.

00:02:57.167 --> 00:03:02.767
Exposure: blood levels beat the 10,000 ng/mL
target in 10 of 10 patients after dose

00:03:02.767 --> 00:03:03.037
two.

00:03:03.325 --> 00:03:07.310
Engagement: no source reports whether
receptors in the tumour were blocked.

00:03:07.597 --> 00:03:11.610
Patients: no validated biomarker to pick
likely responders, and no required

00:03:11.610 --> 00:03:13.750
molecular confirmation of the diagnosis.

00:03:14.037 --> 00:03:20.017
Modality, design, safety: resistance routes
proposed, lower chemotherapy intensity

00:03:20.017 --> 00:03:21.476
raised, pneumonitis.

00:03:21.762 --> 00:03:26.270
Possible explanations, none established: we
rate this failure intermediate in

00:03:26.270 --> 00:03:26.973
obviousness.

00:03:28.078 --> 00:03:32.624
Now, our analysis. Not established fact.
Five hypotheses, each with a test that

00:03:32.624 --> 00:03:33.545
could refute it.

00:03:33.832 --> 00:03:38.161
One: different questions. Shrinkage in one
in ten refractory patients may be too

00:03:38.161 --> 00:03:41.841
small, and too different a measure, to
predict a third fewer events.

00:03:41.841 --> 00:03:43.952
The trial report makes a similar point.

00:03:44.239 --> 00:03:48.671
Two: different diseases. If IGF-1R
dependence grows after first treatment,

00:03:48.671 --> 00:03:53.641
responders were mostly absent here. Test:
compare tumours at diagnosis and relapse.

00:03:53.927 --> 00:03:59.732
Three: the wrong ruler. IGF-1 in blood rose
after dosing, so good blood levels could

00:03:59.732 --> 00:04:04.569
still leave tumour receptors partly free.
Test: biopsies on treatment.

00:04:04.856 --> 00:04:09.500
Four: a second door. In cell studies, Ewing
sarcoma switched to IGF-2 signalling

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:14.087
through insulin receptor A. A drug blocking
both doors would test this; another

00:04:14.087 --> 00:04:15.596
IGF-1R antibody would not.

00:04:15.883 --> 00:04:20.976
Five: thin target evidence. Literature-only
support is a flag worth checking across

00:04:20.976 --> 00:04:22.326
other IGF-1R failures.

00:04:23.408 --> 00:04:28.211
Meanwhile, and not shown to be causes:
cabozantinib drew responses in 26 percent of

00:04:28.211 --> 00:04:32.899
Ewing patients, and R1507, as teprotumumab,
was approved for thyroid eye disease.

00:04:33.186 --> 00:04:36.395
Visible in the registry beforehand:
randomised, yes.

00:04:36.395 --> 00:04:39.172
Overall survival as the primary endpoint,
no.

00:04:39.172 --> 00:04:40.344
Single country, no.

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:45.370
Still not public: a demonstrated cause, a
predictive biomarker, and any regulator's

00:04:45.370 --> 00:04:45.998
assessment.

00:04:46.284 --> 00:04:51.257
Our takeaway: before a big bet, ask whether
the early signal answers the question

00:04:51.257 --> 00:04:52.423
the big trial asks.

00:04:53.488 --> 00:04:58.538
The full case study, with every source, is
at onco-signal.up.railway.app.
